  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When visiting a newly posted Community Labs world \"carrot blue club\" by author \"BEBE CARROT\", I noticed they had an uncomfortably loud song playing that could not be overridden by player audio controls, and in fact was playing loudly even with my world sounds at zero.  Even the master volume had no effect on this. While the world creator did at least have a control to pause the music, it is concerning to see as this is very prone to potential abuse and could even be damaging to the ears of someone not expecting it.  Not being a world creator myself nor having sufficient expertise to explain the reason for the phenomenon, I can only post here the world and creator.  I hope it is enough, thank you.\n\nAlso for the record I did have other friends with me who did confirm that it was not just me this was happening to.",
